# DreamRole Backend – Implementation Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete Node.js/Express backend for the DreamRole Skill Gap Analysis Platform, wired into the existing React/Vite frontend.

---

## Folder Structure Created

```
d:\Innoscence 26\Dreamrole\
├── server/                          ← NEW Express.js backend
│   ├── server.js                    ← Entry point, all routes mounted
│   ├── .env                         ← API keys (OpenAI, port)
│   ├── package.json                 ← Dependencies
│   ├── controllers/
│   │   ├── resumeController.js      ← PDF upload + text extract
│   │   ├── skillsController.js      ← AI skill extraction
│   │   ├── analysisController.js    ← Skill gap + stage + feedback
│   │   ├── testController.js        ← MCQ generation
│   │   ├── recommendationsController.js ← Projects + certs
│   │   ├── mentorController.js      ← Mentor list
│   │   ├── reportController.js      ← PDF report
│   │   └── progressController.js   ← Progress CRUD
│   ├── routes/                      ← One file per endpoint
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── pdfService.js           ← pdf-parse wrapper
│   │   ├── openaiService.js        ← extractSkills, generateFeedback, generateTest
│   │   ├── analysisService.js      ← Gap comparison + stage logic
│   │   ├── dataService.js          ← CSV dataset loader
│   │   └── reportService.js        ← Puppeteer PDF generator
│   ├── utils/
│   │   ├── multerConfig.js          ← PDF-only memory storage
│   │   └── stageClassifier.js       ← Stage thresholds (no score exposed)
│   └── datasets/
│       ├── tech_jobs_comprehensive_dataset.csv  ← 320 role-skill mappings
│       ├── mentors.json             ← 16 industry mentors
│       └── progress.json            ← Progress store
└── Dreamrole/                       ← Existing React frontend (modified)
    ├── vite.config.js               ← Added /api proxy → port 5000
    ├── src/
    │   ├── main.jsx                 ← Wrapped in <AppProvider>
    │   ├── context/AppContext.jsx   ← Shared state (NEW)
    │   └── pages/                   ← All pages updated to call real API
```

---

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/resume/upload` | Upload PDF → return extracted text |
| `POST` | `/api/skills/extract` | Extract skills using OpenAI |
| `POST` | `/api/analysis` | Gap analysis + stage + AI feedback |
| `POST` | `/api/test/generate` | Generate AI MCQ questions |
| `GET`  | `/api/recommendations?role=...` | Projects + certifications |
| `GET`  | `/api/recommendations?roles=true` | All available role names |
| `GET`  | `/api/mentors?role=...` | Role-filtered mentors |
| `POST` | `/api/report/generate` | Download PDF report (Puppeteer) |
| `GET`  | `/api/progress?user_id=...` | Get progress history |
| `POST` | `/api/progress` | Save evaluation attempt |
| `GET`  | `/api/health` | Server health check |

---

## Alignment Stage System (No Numeric Score)

Percentages are computed **internally only** and never sent to the frontend.

| Internal % | Stage Label |
|-----------|-------------|
| 0–29% | **Foundation Stage** |
| 30–54% | **Developing Stage** |
| 55–79% | **Skilled Stage** |
| 80–100% | **Role Ready Stage** |

---

## How to Run

**Terminal 1 – Backend:**
```bash
cd "d:\Innoscence 26\Dreamrole\server"
node server.js
# → 🚀 DreamRole Backend running on http://localhost:5000
```

**Terminal 2 – Frontend:**
```bash
cd "d:\Innoscence 26\Dreamrole\Dreamrole"
npm run dev
# → http://localhost:5173
```

The Vite proxy automatically forwards all `/api/*` calls to the backend.

---

## Complete User Flow (All Real API)

```
Upload PDF resume
    ↓  POST /api/resume/upload  →  resume_text
Extract Skills
    ↓  POST /api/skills/extract  →  ["HTML","React",...]
Select Role
    ↓  GET /api/recommendations?roles=true  →  role list
Skill Gap Analysis
    ↓  POST /api/analysis  →  matched, missing, alignment_stage, feedback
Evaluation Test
    ↓  POST /api/test/generate  →  5 AI-generated MCQ questions
Improvement Roadmap
    ↓  GET /api/recommendations?role=...  →  projects, certifications
Mentor Guidance
    ↓  GET /api/mentors?role=...  →  mentor list
Report Download
    ↓  POST /api/report/generate  →  PDF blob download
Progress Tracking
    ↓  GET /api/progress  →  historical attempts chart
```

